1
00:01:43,710 --> 00:01:47,850
[KING OF COMEDY]

2
00:01:48,440 --> 00:01:50,950
[Episode 16]

3
00:01:51,280 --> 00:01:52,750
After you left last night,

4
00:01:52,750 --> 00:01:54,470
Mr. Liang Long felt unwell
and was hospitalized.

5
00:01:54,470 --> 00:01:56,670
He can't do the upcoming performances.

6
00:01:58,590 --> 00:01:59,120
Hospitalized?

7
00:01:59,120 --> 00:01:59,840
Thanks to Mr. Zhou?

8
00:01:59,840 --> 00:02:01,230
Mr. Liang Long was hospitalized?

9
00:02:01,230 --> 00:02:02,480
Mr. Zhou went to see Liang Long,

10
00:02:02,480 --> 00:02:03,430
and Liang Long was hospitalized?

11
00:02:03,430 --> 00:02:05,180
Mr. Zhou beat him up?

12
00:02:05,220 --> 00:02:06,350
I didn't.

13
00:02:07,480 --> 00:02:08,030
I didn't.

14
00:02:08,030 --> 00:02:09,030
You are actually more ruthless than me.

15
00:02:09,030 --> 00:02:10,470
No, I just sang a song.

16
00:02:11,870 --> 00:02:12,560
I didn't.

17
00:02:12,800 --> 00:02:14,000
No, don't overthink it.

18
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:14,910
It has nothing to do with me.

19
00:02:14,910 --> 00:02:16,170
That's a coincidence.

20
00:02:16,310 --> 00:02:16,870
It really is a coincidence.

21
00:02:16,870 --> 00:02:17,520
I didn't.

22
00:02:17,590 --> 00:02:18,310
I announce,

23
00:02:18,910 --> 00:02:20,360
from now on,

24
00:02:20,560 --> 00:02:22,000
you are Shapu's

25
00:02:22,800 --> 00:02:23,840
second toughest man.

26
00:02:23,840 --> 00:02:24,750
No, I didn't.

27
00:02:24,770 --> 00:02:25,870
Well, what I said is true.

28
00:02:25,870 --> 00:02:27,000
-I didn't get physical with him.
-Folks.

29
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:27,810
Folks.

30
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:29,310
Optimism is a good thing,

31
00:02:29,310 --> 00:02:31,710
but blind optimism will cause big trouble.

32
00:02:33,070 --> 00:02:34,280
No matter what improper means

33
00:02:34,280 --> 00:02:36,360
Mr. Zhou used...

34
00:02:36,360 --> 00:02:38,450
-I didn't.
-Or maybe it's just a coincidence.

35
00:02:38,450 --> 00:02:39,090
Coincidence.

36
00:02:39,090 --> 00:02:40,620
I am willing to believe you.

37
00:02:41,070 --> 00:02:42,560
I guess it's a good thing.

38
00:02:43,280 --> 00:02:44,630
It puts Chuanao Village and us

39
00:02:44,630 --> 00:02:46,470
back on the same starting line, right?

40
00:02:46,470 --> 00:02:46,970
Right?

41
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:47,470
Right, right, right.

42
00:02:47,470 --> 00:02:50,000
And based on Mr. Zhou's
little contribution,

43
00:02:50,070 --> 00:02:51,150
I have another

44
00:02:51,430 --> 00:02:52,090
great idea.

45
00:02:52,680 --> 00:02:53,360
Why don't we

46
00:02:53,910 --> 00:02:54,850
go back to the room and talk?

47
00:02:54,850 --> 00:02:55,970
Okay, let's talk.

48
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:57,030
Let's talk.

49
00:02:57,120 --> 00:02:58,360
I-I really didn't.

50
00:02:58,360 --> 00:02:58,750
Well...

51
00:02:58,750 --> 00:03:00,080
Mr. Zhou, you are too...

52
00:03:00,420 --> 00:03:01,600
too much.

53
00:03:01,630 --> 00:03:02,240
I didn't.

54
00:03:02,240 --> 00:03:03,840
Given our friendship with Liang Long,

55
00:03:03,840 --> 00:03:05,520
we even sang for him alone.

56
00:03:05,520 --> 00:03:07,000
-Don't do such extreme things.
-See them out.

57
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:07,930
Very dangerous.

58
00:03:08,280 --> 00:03:09,520
I didn't, Zhen.

59
00:03:10,360 --> 00:03:11,650
I just sang a song.

60
00:03:11,680 --> 00:03:13,520
And I even sang that song for you...

61
00:03:13,520 --> 00:03:14,450
Did you learn it,

62
00:03:14,560 --> 00:03:15,150
Silly Qiang?

63
00:03:15,150 --> 00:03:15,810
Learned it.

64
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:16,710
So ruthless.

65
00:03:16,710 --> 00:03:17,710
It's not like that.

66
00:03:17,710 --> 00:03:18,680
I didn't.

67
00:03:18,680 --> 00:03:20,240
Chen Junnan, you always...

68
00:03:20,870 --> 00:03:21,870
How could he be...

69
00:03:21,960 --> 00:03:22,820
hospitalized?

70
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:23,470
I...

71
00:03:23,700 --> 00:03:24,360
Ke, tell me the truth.

72
00:03:24,360 --> 00:03:25,030
Tell me the truth.

73
00:03:25,030 --> 00:03:25,870
There's no one else here now.

74
00:03:25,870 --> 00:03:26,930
Did you beat him up?

75
00:03:26,960 --> 00:03:27,400
How could I?

76
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:28,710
There's criminal liability for this.

77
00:03:28,710 --> 00:03:30,030
I didn't. How could I?

78
00:03:30,030 --> 00:03:30,829
Are you crazy?

79
00:03:31,470 --> 00:03:32,000
It's over.

80
00:03:32,000 --> 00:03:33,400
This gave him a bold idea.

81
00:03:35,120 --> 00:03:36,030
We have the means now.

82
00:03:36,030 --> 00:03:37,280
Ximei, do you know any other bands?

83
00:03:37,280 --> 00:03:38,710
W-We should invite them.

84
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:39,730
Invite more?

85
00:03:40,560 --> 00:03:42,560
You already made Wudiren disband.

86
00:03:42,560 --> 00:03:44,000
You put Liang Long in the hospital.

87
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:44,470
That has nothing to do—

88
00:03:44,470 --> 00:03:46,730
The rock scene is about
to grind to a halt.

89
00:03:46,960 --> 00:03:48,000
Winter is coming

90
00:03:48,150 --> 00:03:49,150
for the bands.

91
00:03:49,310 --> 00:03:49,750
Don't say that.

92
00:03:49,750 --> 00:03:50,400
Look,

93
00:03:50,590 --> 00:03:51,870
let's leave a lifeline

94
00:03:52,030 --> 00:03:53,280
for the Chinese music scene.

95
00:03:53,280 --> 00:03:53,910
You don't believe me either?

96
00:03:53,910 --> 00:03:54,710
I mean...

97
00:03:54,970 --> 00:03:56,280
-I really didn't—
-No matter what the reason is,

98
00:03:56,280 --> 00:03:58,070
I do really like Liang Long.

99
00:03:58,240 --> 00:04:00,080
He may wear skirts and lipstick,

100
00:04:00,150 --> 00:04:01,880
but you put him in the hospital.

101
00:04:02,750 --> 00:04:04,350
You don't believe me either?

102
00:04:04,590 --> 00:04:05,190
Why...

103
00:04:08,240 --> 00:04:09,440
was he hospitalized?

104
00:04:10,430 --> 00:04:12,120
Wasn't he moved?

105
00:04:13,440 --> 00:04:15,760
[So what really went down?
Let's watch the clip.]

106
00:04:27,920 --> 00:04:30,390
I don't know if it'll make
the diarrhea worse

107
00:04:30,390 --> 00:04:31,480
or if it'll just have no effect at all.

108
00:04:31,480 --> 00:04:32,150
Will it kill anyone?

109
00:04:32,150 --> 00:04:33,080
Definitely not.

110
00:04:38,360 --> 00:04:38,720
Here.

111
00:04:39,150 --> 00:04:41,430
Give this bottle of fine French wine

112
00:04:41,430 --> 00:04:42,000
to him.

113
00:04:43,390 --> 00:04:44,630
Make sure you watch him drink it.

114
00:04:44,630 --> 00:04:45,360
Okay, okay.

115
00:04:46,430 --> 00:04:48,040
I brought you a bottle of wine

116
00:04:48,040 --> 00:04:49,240
to show my sincerity.

117
00:04:49,560 --> 00:04:51,220
Keep it and drink it yourself.

118
00:04:56,950 --> 00:04:58,480
A genuine Second Hand villager.

119
00:04:58,480 --> 00:04:59,000
Family.

120
00:05:00,070 --> 00:05:00,800
True family.

121
00:05:01,120 --> 00:05:01,680
I...

122
00:05:02,360 --> 00:05:03,360
See the guest out.

123
00:05:07,310 --> 00:05:10,270
Pure music is always misunderstood.

124
00:05:19,240 --> 00:05:20,040
Stop arguing!

125
00:05:20,120 --> 00:05:21,480
Stop arguing! Let me say a few words!

126
00:05:21,480 --> 00:05:22,940
Listen to me! Listen to me!

127
00:05:23,310 --> 00:05:24,720
This matter has absolutely nothing

128
00:05:24,720 --> 00:05:25,910
to do with Ms. Ma.

129
00:05:25,930 --> 00:05:27,160
This is Second Hand Pants'

130
00:05:27,160 --> 00:05:28,830
unilateral breach of contract!

131
00:05:28,830 --> 00:05:30,630
Everyone, let me say a few words.

132
00:05:31,120 --> 00:05:32,920
I am Mr. Liang Long's attorney.

133
00:05:33,480 --> 00:05:34,150
We came here

134
00:05:34,190 --> 00:05:36,240
as a personal favor to Ms. Ma.

135
00:05:36,310 --> 00:05:37,830
We didn't sign any contracts,

136
00:05:37,830 --> 00:05:39,960
so there is no compensation involved.

137
00:05:43,070 --> 00:05:44,680
Where did this lawyer come from?

138
00:05:44,680 --> 00:05:46,409
There was no one there just now.

139
00:05:48,600 --> 00:05:49,680
Stop arguing!

140
00:05:49,680 --> 00:05:51,680
I already told you! What's going on?

141
00:05:53,120 --> 00:05:54,360
Why are you two so arrogant?

142
00:05:54,360 --> 00:05:55,630
Can't you understand what I'm saying?

143
00:05:55,630 --> 00:05:56,150
President.

144
00:05:56,150 --> 00:05:57,600
You have to give us an explanation.

145
00:05:57,600 --> 00:05:59,130
Look, they're all arguing.

146
00:05:59,150 --> 00:06:00,000
Quiet down.

147
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:04,310
As the president
of our village's business association,

148
00:06:04,310 --> 00:06:05,510
let me say a few words.

149
00:06:07,560 --> 00:06:08,360
Ms. Ma.

150
00:06:11,920 --> 00:06:12,870
Look,

151
00:06:13,040 --> 00:06:13,920
this matter

152
00:06:14,240 --> 00:06:15,560
is really your fault.

153
00:06:16,160 --> 00:06:18,040
You have to give everyone an explanation.

154
00:06:18,040 --> 00:06:18,310
I...

155
00:06:19,120 --> 00:06:19,560
I was wrong?

156
00:06:19,560 --> 00:06:20,190
-Right.
-Right.

157
00:06:20,190 --> 00:06:22,000
Well, what's wrong with you?

158
00:06:24,600 --> 00:06:25,270
Look.

159
00:06:25,750 --> 00:06:27,120
These merchants

160
00:06:27,160 --> 00:06:28,420
suffered heavy losses

161
00:06:28,830 --> 00:06:30,920
because of this concert, Ms. Ma.

162
00:06:31,240 --> 00:06:32,560
You have to think about

163
00:06:33,630 --> 00:06:35,830
how to compensate them, Ms. Ma.

164
00:06:36,630 --> 00:06:39,190
Me compensate? You're really something.

165
00:06:41,630 --> 00:06:42,750
Stop arguing!

166
00:06:43,360 --> 00:06:44,000
Quiet!

167
00:06:46,390 --> 00:06:47,430
Regarding this matter,

168
00:06:47,430 --> 00:06:49,600
we will definitely give everyone
a reasonable explanation.

169
00:06:49,600 --> 00:06:51,200
Everyone, go back for today.

170
00:06:51,360 --> 00:06:53,290
We won't let you suffer any losses.

171
00:06:53,430 --> 00:06:55,030
How can we not suffer losses?

172
00:06:55,870 --> 00:06:56,630
Quiet!

173
00:06:57,390 --> 00:06:58,240
If you don't believe her,

174
00:06:58,240 --> 00:06:59,440
don't you believe me?

175
00:07:00,190 --> 00:07:01,040
Go home, everyone!

176
00:07:01,040 --> 00:07:01,720
Wait.

177
00:07:02,070 --> 00:07:03,190
Chief, I...

178
00:07:06,750 --> 00:07:07,920
Leave! Leave!

179
00:07:08,160 --> 00:07:09,160
Leave, come on.

180
00:07:09,160 --> 00:07:10,220
Hurry up and leave.

181
00:07:12,160 --> 00:07:12,800
Leave!

182
00:07:15,430 --> 00:07:16,290
Leave, come on.

183
00:07:23,800 --> 00:07:25,190
From now on, all decisions

184
00:07:25,190 --> 00:07:27,590
must be approved by the village committee.

185
00:07:27,800 --> 00:07:29,240
Otherwise, we will follow the contract

186
00:07:29,240 --> 00:07:31,370
and take back your management rights.

187
00:07:36,560 --> 00:07:37,560
As for the villagers,

188
00:07:37,560 --> 00:07:38,870
I'll calm their nerves.

189
00:07:38,870 --> 00:07:42,200
You need to provide
a compensation plan as soon as possible.

190
00:07:52,070 --> 00:07:53,270
We're doomed.

191
00:07:53,330 --> 00:07:54,150
What should we do?

192
00:07:54,150 --> 00:07:55,150
Darling, darling.

193
00:07:55,150 --> 00:07:56,870
It's okay. It's not your fault.

194
00:07:56,870 --> 00:07:58,480
This is all Mr. Ma's fault.

195
00:07:59,070 --> 00:07:59,720
Dad.

196
00:08:00,120 --> 00:08:01,120
Hello, Chairman.

197
00:08:02,630 --> 00:08:04,830
What should we do?

198
00:08:06,510 --> 00:08:07,120
That's enough.

199
00:08:07,120 --> 00:08:07,980
That's enough.

200
00:08:08,270 --> 00:08:08,720
A little more.

201
00:08:08,720 --> 00:08:09,650
Why are you here?

202
00:08:10,430 --> 00:08:11,600
I asked him to come.

203
00:08:14,240 --> 00:08:15,560
What I mean is,

204
00:08:15,560 --> 00:08:16,360
you two should sit down

205
00:08:16,360 --> 00:08:17,430
and have a good talk.

206
00:08:17,430 --> 00:08:19,490
I have nothing to talk about with him.

207
00:08:20,480 --> 00:08:21,120
Feiyan.

208
00:08:22,830 --> 00:08:23,680
I heard

209
00:08:24,120 --> 00:08:24,780
that you are

210
00:08:25,630 --> 00:08:27,560
having some difficulties
with your project.

211
00:08:27,560 --> 00:08:29,020
I thought I could help you.

212
00:08:29,040 --> 00:08:30,190
Thanks for your kindness,

213
00:08:30,190 --> 00:08:31,250
but I don't need it.

214
00:08:31,390 --> 00:08:32,200
Feiyan,

215
00:08:32,390 --> 00:08:33,789
you are too competitive.

216
00:08:34,320 --> 00:08:36,179
And you're really short-handed.

217
00:08:36,440 --> 00:08:37,960
Our family is not short of money.

218
00:08:37,960 --> 00:08:38,870
Take him for example.

219
00:08:38,870 --> 00:08:39,750
For so many years,

220
00:08:39,750 --> 00:08:41,600
he's a secretary, chef, bodyguard,

221
00:08:41,600 --> 00:08:42,600
driver, and coffee maker.

222
00:08:42,600 --> 00:08:43,600
He does these jobs all by himself.

223
00:08:43,600 --> 00:08:44,860
I will get you two more.

224
00:08:44,960 --> 00:08:45,910
He won't do it.

225
00:08:48,080 --> 00:08:50,240
H-H-He can do it.

226
00:08:51,270 --> 00:08:51,730
He can.

227
00:08:52,840 --> 00:08:54,440
You haven't replaced him for years.

228
00:08:54,440 --> 00:08:55,600
He must be very capable.

229
00:08:55,600 --> 00:08:56,910
Right, Feiyan?

230
00:08:58,390 --> 00:09:00,480
Is he like Ms. Zhang in our family?

231
00:09:00,500 --> 00:09:01,900
How can that be the same?

232
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:02,720
Seriously,

233
00:09:03,530 --> 00:09:04,560
what I mean is,

234
00:09:04,850 --> 00:09:05,520
I'm saying,

235
00:09:05,540 --> 00:09:07,600
you should stop fighting each other.

236
00:09:07,720 --> 00:09:09,180
Let me give you an example.

237
00:09:09,200 --> 00:09:09,550
Look,

238
00:09:10,270 --> 00:09:11,530
this one chopstick...

239
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:16,360
This one chopstick...

240
00:09:18,360 --> 00:09:18,870
This one chopstick—

241
00:09:18,870 --> 00:09:20,410
Dad, stop with the chopsticks.

242
00:09:20,410 --> 00:09:21,790
I know what you mean. That's enough.

243
00:09:21,790 --> 00:09:22,600
If I don't break it,

244
00:09:22,600 --> 00:09:23,840
how can I give this example?

245
00:09:23,840 --> 00:09:24,630
What Dad means is,

246
00:09:24,630 --> 00:09:25,840
one chopstick

247
00:09:25,840 --> 00:09:26,600
can be broken.

248
00:09:26,600 --> 00:09:28,200
But a bunch of chopsticks...

249
00:09:32,240 --> 00:09:34,220
I said I don't need it.

250
00:09:35,120 --> 00:09:35,650
Let's go.

251
00:09:38,480 --> 00:09:39,540
I'll go talk to her.

252
00:09:43,390 --> 00:09:44,250
Secretary Liu.

253
00:09:45,440 --> 00:09:46,840
Mr. Huang, you can stop here.

254
00:09:46,840 --> 00:09:48,170
I'm not looking for her.

255
00:09:49,150 --> 00:09:50,280
I'm looking for you.

256
00:09:52,630 --> 00:09:53,690
This bottle of wine

257
00:09:53,750 --> 00:09:54,350
is for you.

258
00:09:55,120 --> 00:09:56,510
It's a token of my appreciation.

259
00:09:56,510 --> 00:09:57,770
Make sure you drink it.

260
00:09:59,750 --> 00:10:00,200
Okay.

261
00:10:00,630 --> 00:10:00,960
Here.

262
00:10:02,240 --> 00:10:02,840
Thank you.

263
00:10:28,510 --> 00:10:29,370
Secretary Liu.

264
00:10:30,080 --> 00:10:31,480
My dear brother-in-law.

265
00:10:31,870 --> 00:10:33,670
Please allow me to call you that.

266
00:10:34,120 --> 00:10:35,670
Actually, about you and Feiyan,

267
00:10:35,670 --> 00:10:37,130
I've known for a long time.

268
00:10:37,550 --> 00:10:39,360
Our goals are the same now.

269
00:10:39,670 --> 00:10:41,900
We both hope to introduce
ourselves to outsiders

270
00:10:41,900 --> 00:10:44,360
as the live-in sons-in-law
of the Ma family.

271
00:10:44,390 --> 00:10:45,720
I hope we can cooperate.

272
00:10:45,960 --> 00:10:48,420
I will find 2 capable assistants
to help you.

273
00:11:04,590 --> 00:11:08,100
[Secretary Liu, we'll help you
with your business in Shapo.]

274
00:11:14,750 --> 00:11:15,810
Look, what is that?

275
00:11:16,270 --> 00:11:16,870
What is it?

276
00:11:19,390 --> 00:11:20,030
Brother.

277
00:11:20,030 --> 00:11:21,390
Look, what is that?

278
00:11:23,750 --> 00:11:24,790
A sea monster!

279
00:11:25,240 --> 00:11:26,960
-A sea monster!
-A sea monster!

280
00:11:26,960 --> 00:11:27,630
Run!

281
00:11:30,720 --> 00:11:31,520
A sea monster!

282
00:11:33,080 --> 00:11:33,750
Here!

283
00:11:33,750 --> 00:11:34,380
It's over there!

284
00:11:34,380 --> 00:11:35,090
It's right there!

285
00:11:35,090 --> 00:11:36,820
It looks like it's coming over!

286
00:11:38,840 --> 00:11:39,440
The sea monster turned!

287
00:11:39,440 --> 00:11:40,640
The sea monster left!

288
00:11:43,720 --> 00:11:44,670
A sea monster!

289
00:11:45,320 --> 00:11:47,960
A sea monster!

290
00:11:48,150 --> 00:11:50,200
It's coming again! Run!

291
00:11:50,270 --> 00:11:53,360
A sea monster!

292
00:11:53,390 --> 00:11:54,120
Hurry up!

293
00:11:56,790 --> 00:11:59,720
-Run!
-Run!

294
00:12:02,840 --> 00:12:03,770
It's coming!

295
00:12:38,030 --> 00:12:39,120
Is this the place?

296
00:12:39,670 --> 00:12:40,600
Did you see it here?

297
00:12:40,600 --> 00:12:41,600
Yes, it was here.

298
00:12:46,440 --> 00:12:48,480
I've been in the village
for over 30 years.

299
00:12:48,480 --> 00:12:50,340
I've never heard of a sea monster.

300
00:12:51,150 --> 00:12:51,790
Chief Fang,

301
00:12:51,790 --> 00:12:53,320
I actually have heard of it.

302
00:12:53,350 --> 00:12:54,260
When I was a kid,

303
00:12:54,290 --> 00:12:56,240
I heard old fishermen
talk about this legend.

304
00:12:56,240 --> 00:12:57,970
But that was all in the deep sea.

305
00:12:58,200 --> 00:12:59,360
I've heard of it too.

306
00:12:59,390 --> 00:13:00,630
Maybe the sea monster

307
00:13:00,630 --> 00:13:03,090
came from the deep sea
to the shallow waters.

308
00:13:03,480 --> 00:13:04,120
Alright.

309
00:13:04,440 --> 00:13:05,720
Whether there's a sea monster or not,

310
00:13:05,720 --> 00:13:07,270
notify the tourists immediately

311
00:13:07,270 --> 00:13:08,670
not to go into the sea recently.

312
00:13:08,670 --> 00:13:09,960
-Got it, okay.
-Okay.

313
00:13:13,670 --> 00:13:15,440
Why are there more people now?

314
00:13:16,390 --> 00:13:18,200
Once people heard about the sea monster,

315
00:13:18,200 --> 00:13:19,200
the number of tourists drawn by it

316
00:13:19,200 --> 00:13:20,510
has actually increased.

317
00:13:20,510 --> 00:13:21,360
Yeah.

318
00:13:21,600 --> 00:13:23,260
Aren't they afraid of danger?

319
00:13:23,750 --> 00:13:25,000
Chief Fang, let me tell you.

320
00:13:25,000 --> 00:13:26,080
Tourists nowadays

321
00:13:26,240 --> 00:13:27,840
go wherever it's dangerous.

322
00:13:28,000 --> 00:13:29,000
Like recently,

323
00:13:29,200 --> 00:13:30,000
Ailao Mountains

324
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:30,840
are so popular.

325
00:13:30,840 --> 00:13:32,000
There are so many people.

326
00:13:32,000 --> 00:13:32,550
Yeah.

327
00:13:34,040 --> 00:13:36,500
I just feel this whole thing
is a bit strange.

328
00:13:37,500 --> 00:13:39,490
[Biggest Discovery of the Year:
Sea Monster Spotted in Chuanao Village]

329
00:13:40,190 --> 00:13:41,510
[A sea monster from Chuanao Village]

330
00:13:47,030 --> 00:13:47,670
It just came out.

331
00:13:47,670 --> 00:13:48,080
It was so scary.

332
00:13:48,080 --> 00:13:48,670
It scared me so much

333
00:13:48,670 --> 00:13:50,270
that I quickly covered my glasses.

334
00:13:50,270 --> 00:13:51,270
I didn't even dare to look at it.

335
00:13:51,270 --> 00:13:52,600
It came. So big.

336
00:13:52,600 --> 00:13:53,550
Such a big fish.

337
00:13:53,550 --> 00:13:54,880
That thing was this big.

338
00:13:55,550 --> 00:13:57,120
It suddenly opened its big mouth.

339
00:13:57,120 --> 00:13:58,790
Its teeth looked like big radishes.

340
00:13:58,790 --> 00:13:59,860
Those big teeth were all exposed.

341
00:13:59,860 --> 00:14:01,950
Its back looked a bit like Godzilla.

342
00:14:03,080 --> 00:14:04,510
If I had walked a step slower, I tell you,

343
00:14:04,510 --> 00:14:05,630
you wouldn't be seeing me today.

344
00:14:05,630 --> 00:14:06,150
That big monster!

345
00:14:06,150 --> 00:14:07,030
So scary!

346
00:14:07,050 --> 00:14:08,840
I-It scared me to death.

347
00:14:08,870 --> 00:14:10,800
Jiaoqi, I didn't even dare to look.

348
00:14:11,840 --> 00:14:13,790
Sea monster?

349
00:14:14,910 --> 00:14:17,110
Based on my years of acting experience,

350
00:14:17,790 --> 00:14:19,630
their acting is too obvious.

351
00:14:20,550 --> 00:14:23,080
It's a bit fake.
There must be something wrong.

352
00:14:23,080 --> 00:14:26,530
Besides, has this thing
ever appeared in your sea?

353
00:14:27,480 --> 00:14:29,200
Yes, I've heard of it.

354
00:14:29,550 --> 00:14:30,890
The sea is so big; anything is possible.

355
00:14:30,890 --> 00:14:32,900
But that was probably
when my grandpa was a kid.

356
00:14:32,900 --> 00:14:33,830
I've heard of it.

357
00:14:34,080 --> 00:14:35,440
It happened
just when Chuanao Village's tourism

358
00:14:35,440 --> 00:14:36,700
was failing.

359
00:14:36,790 --> 00:14:39,390
This sea monster appeared
at the perfect time.

360
00:14:40,270 --> 00:14:40,930
Bingqiang.

361
00:14:41,270 --> 00:14:43,360
Are you saying there's something wrong
with the sea monster?

362
00:14:43,360 --> 00:14:45,480
There's definitely something fishy
going on.

363
00:14:45,480 --> 00:14:47,550
Didn't I say that first?

364
00:14:49,320 --> 00:14:50,870
There's definitely a problem.

365
00:14:50,870 --> 00:14:51,550
And look,

366
00:14:51,550 --> 00:14:54,150
it just so happened
that they were acting here.

367
00:14:55,320 --> 00:14:56,480
Does this mean

368
00:14:57,960 --> 00:15:00,290
Chuanao Village
has been partnering with them all along?

369
00:15:00,290 --> 00:15:01,240
It was too fast.

370
00:15:01,240 --> 00:15:03,500
I couldn't see what it looked like at all.

371
00:15:03,600 --> 00:15:04,530
What do you mean?

372
00:15:04,630 --> 00:15:05,830
I've seen this video.

373
00:15:05,960 --> 00:15:07,300
But what do you mean by what do I mean?

374
00:15:07,300 --> 00:15:08,930
What do you mean by what do we mean?

375
00:15:08,930 --> 00:15:09,880
My phone.

376
00:15:12,960 --> 00:15:14,790
You actually came up with
this sea monster thing.

377
00:15:14,790 --> 00:15:16,360
Don't you think it's ridiculous?

378
00:15:16,360 --> 00:15:16,690
Wait.

379
00:15:17,010 --> 00:15:18,730
Do you have any proof?

380
00:15:18,840 --> 00:15:20,720
You're making baseless accusations here.

381
00:15:20,720 --> 00:15:22,910
This has nothing to do with me.

382
00:15:23,200 --> 00:15:24,600
Besides, my level of education

383
00:15:24,600 --> 00:15:25,510
wouldn't allow me to do that.

384
00:15:25,510 --> 00:15:26,110
Thank you.

385
00:15:26,790 --> 00:15:29,030
The sea monster appeared yesterday,
and merchandise is out today.

386
00:15:29,030 --> 00:15:30,200
Is that reasonable?

387
00:15:31,080 --> 00:15:32,600
It's not reasonable.

388
00:15:32,840 --> 00:15:34,550
Then what does that have to do with me?

389
00:15:34,550 --> 00:15:35,790
It better have nothing to do with you.

390
00:15:35,790 --> 00:15:37,850
But I will definitely look into this.

391
00:15:38,440 --> 00:15:38,770
Wait.

392
00:15:39,120 --> 00:15:40,750
It's fine. Let her investigate.

393
00:15:40,750 --> 00:15:41,870
With our level of education,

394
00:15:41,870 --> 00:15:42,840
we wouldn't do such a thing.

395
00:15:42,840 --> 00:15:44,240
Come on, Ms. Ma, let's go.

396
00:15:48,670 --> 00:15:49,440
Why did she leave?

397
00:15:49,440 --> 00:15:49,840
She...

398
00:15:51,150 --> 00:15:52,080
She got emotional and left.

399
00:15:52,080 --> 00:15:52,480
She...

400
00:15:52,480 --> 00:15:53,390
She forgot her phone.

401
00:15:53,390 --> 00:15:54,390
Delete the video.

402
00:15:55,510 --> 00:15:57,710
We didn't do it. Why are you deleting it?

403
00:15:57,840 --> 00:15:58,390
In all my life,

404
00:15:58,390 --> 00:15:59,870
I've never known the meaning of fear.

405
00:15:59,870 --> 00:16:01,390
Behind you. Behind you.

406
00:16:02,550 --> 00:16:03,270
Behind you.

407
00:16:09,200 --> 00:16:11,260
But I have to say, this is a smart move.

408
00:16:11,480 --> 00:16:13,670
You can't touch him without evidence.

409
00:16:15,120 --> 00:16:17,150
Unless we find some.

410
00:16:19,550 --> 00:16:20,010
I got it.

411
00:16:21,550 --> 00:16:22,480
Do you remember

412
00:16:23,080 --> 00:16:23,840
how they used Fei

413
00:16:23,840 --> 00:16:25,840
to pretend to defect to us last time?

414
00:16:26,200 --> 00:16:28,630
We can give them
a taste of their own medicine.

415
00:16:28,630 --> 00:16:30,000
We can also send someone

416
00:16:30,000 --> 00:16:32,060
to pretend to defect to that village.

417
00:16:32,670 --> 00:16:33,840
So now, we need someone

418
00:16:33,840 --> 00:16:35,270
brave and smart to go.

419
00:16:36,240 --> 00:16:37,910
Then it has to be me.

420
00:16:38,270 --> 00:16:38,740
Jiahao.

421
00:16:38,770 --> 00:16:39,120
I...

422
00:16:39,120 --> 00:16:41,270
Y-You have to take charge in the village,

423
00:16:41,270 --> 00:16:41,690
right?

424
00:16:41,790 --> 00:16:44,110
Especially
with the female village chief...

425
00:16:44,110 --> 00:16:46,150
-Yeah, I...
-What if you surrender to the enemy again?

426
00:16:46,150 --> 00:16:48,750
Right, I have to take charge.
They need me here.

427
00:16:48,790 --> 00:16:50,270
Then it has to be me.

428
00:16:51,150 --> 00:16:52,750
I'll go meet that sea monster

429
00:16:53,000 --> 00:16:54,360
and see who's faster.

430
00:16:54,670 --> 00:16:55,720
Okay, okay. Alright.

431
00:16:55,720 --> 00:16:56,600
Alright, you—

432
00:16:56,600 --> 00:16:57,390
I think

433
00:16:57,980 --> 00:16:59,510
we should let Bingqiang go.

434
00:17:00,440 --> 00:17:01,600
Bingqiang is good-looking,

435
00:17:01,600 --> 00:17:02,480
smart,

436
00:17:02,480 --> 00:17:04,480
and reliable, right?

437
00:17:04,750 --> 00:17:05,810
Bingqiang is good.

438
00:17:05,920 --> 00:17:07,160
-I'll go.
-Well…

439
00:17:07,930 --> 00:17:08,440
Excuse me.

440
00:17:08,440 --> 00:17:10,109
I... I'm not denying your ability.

441
00:17:10,109 --> 00:17:12,640
We can say this is an undercover mission.

442
00:17:12,920 --> 00:17:13,920
We've all seen "Infernal Affairs."

443
00:17:13,920 --> 00:17:15,579
This requires acting skills.

444
00:17:15,640 --> 00:17:18,160
And that happens to be my comfort zone.

445
00:17:19,069 --> 00:17:20,069
This is my field.

446
00:17:20,480 --> 00:17:22,109
They think we're just partners.

447
00:17:22,109 --> 00:17:23,680
It's the same if I go there.

448
00:17:23,680 --> 00:17:25,000
I'll pretend to defect.

449
00:17:25,000 --> 00:17:26,160
So, how about...

450
00:17:27,960 --> 00:17:28,400
I do it?

451
00:17:29,000 --> 00:17:30,030
Is that okay, President?

452
00:17:30,030 --> 00:17:30,400
Okay.

453
00:17:30,640 --> 00:17:31,030
Okay.

454
00:17:31,110 --> 00:17:31,400
Good.

455
00:17:31,400 --> 00:17:31,880
Mr. Zhou.

456
00:17:31,880 --> 00:17:32,680
Then I'll go.

457
00:17:32,680 --> 00:17:33,270
-Thank you, President.
-Good.

458
00:17:33,270 --> 00:17:34,030
Thank you, President.

459
00:17:34,030 --> 00:17:34,480
Good.

460
00:17:35,480 --> 00:17:36,550
Then let's tentatively call this mission

461
00:17:36,550 --> 00:17:38,480
to take down the sea monster

462
00:17:38,790 --> 00:17:40,050
"Operation Monster."

463
00:17:40,270 --> 00:17:42,640
Okay, let's start!

464
00:18:06,110 --> 00:18:08,030
The wind is howling;

465
00:18:09,270 --> 00:18:10,640
the Yi River is cold.

466
00:18:12,030 --> 00:18:13,000
The warrior—

467
00:18:13,000 --> 00:18:13,720
Stop reciting nonsense.

468
00:18:13,720 --> 00:18:14,110
I...

469
00:18:16,830 --> 00:18:17,400
Ke.

470
00:18:18,430 --> 00:18:20,170
It doesn't matter if this mission

471
00:18:20,170 --> 00:18:22,260
is successful or not.

472
00:18:22,720 --> 00:18:24,830
What's important is that
you take care of yourself

473
00:18:24,830 --> 00:18:25,630
and stay safe.

474
00:18:26,330 --> 00:18:27,100
Don't worry.

475
00:18:27,270 --> 00:18:28,830
I will definitely assist Mr. Zhou

476
00:18:28,830 --> 00:18:31,090
in successfully infiltrating Chuanao.

477
00:18:31,270 --> 00:18:33,400
Investigate carefully and slowly.

478
00:18:33,400 --> 00:18:35,110
Make everything clear.

479
00:18:35,440 --> 00:18:37,640
No rush to come back. I'll hold the fort.

480
00:18:39,440 --> 00:18:40,550
Thanks for your hard work.

481
00:18:40,550 --> 00:18:41,280
It's my duty.

482
00:18:44,240 --> 00:18:45,040
Where is Zhen?

483
00:18:45,480 --> 00:18:46,610
Zhen is taking a nap.

484
00:18:46,640 --> 00:18:47,640
She was sleeping soundly,

485
00:18:47,640 --> 00:18:49,400
so I closed the door for her.

486
00:18:50,110 --> 00:18:51,970
You go first. I'll tell her later.

487
00:18:52,250 --> 00:18:52,710
Thanks.

488
00:18:53,750 --> 00:18:54,680
You're welcome.

489
00:19:04,240 --> 00:19:05,040
Wait a minute!

490
00:19:05,240 --> 00:19:06,040
Wait a minute!

491
00:19:06,680 --> 00:19:07,160
Zhen.

492
00:19:10,750 --> 00:19:11,550
What's wrong?

493
00:19:11,550 --> 00:19:13,240
I have something very important.

494
00:19:13,240 --> 00:19:13,720
Tell me.

495
00:19:14,550 --> 00:19:16,010
The last time we got a room,

496
00:19:18,480 --> 00:19:19,610
it was for business.

497
00:19:19,810 --> 00:19:20,920
When you pass by Chuanao,

498
00:19:20,920 --> 00:19:22,160
help me get the receipt.

499
00:19:22,160 --> 00:19:23,560
I want to get reimbursed.

500
00:19:26,480 --> 00:19:27,550
Is that it?

501
00:19:28,790 --> 00:19:29,510
You must remember.

502
00:19:29,510 --> 00:19:29,880
I'll remember.

503
00:19:29,880 --> 00:19:30,350
Definitely.

504
00:19:30,350 --> 00:19:30,830
Definitely.

505
00:19:30,830 --> 00:19:31,640
-Okay.
-Okay.

506
00:19:32,160 --> 00:19:33,550
Then I'll go.

507
00:19:39,080 --> 00:19:39,880
Wait a minute.

508
00:19:43,110 --> 00:19:43,910
What's wrong?

509
00:19:45,200 --> 00:19:46,060
This is for you.

510
00:19:47,750 --> 00:19:48,410
Nunchucks?

511
00:19:48,720 --> 00:19:49,830
This is the stick
I use to make fish balls.

512
00:19:49,830 --> 00:19:51,030
I modified it for you.

513
00:19:51,080 --> 00:19:53,160
You'll definitely get beaten up there.

514
00:19:53,160 --> 00:19:54,560
Take it to save your life.

515
00:20:07,290 --> 00:20:08,370
Time to go!

516
00:20:08,400 --> 00:20:10,640
-So handsome.
-Please watch out when reversing.

517
00:20:10,640 --> 00:20:12,030
Please watch out when reversing.

518
00:20:12,030 --> 00:20:12,760
So handsome.

519
00:20:13,440 --> 00:20:14,030
-Back up!
-Jiahao!

520
00:20:14,030 --> 00:20:15,110
Jiahao, Jiahao!

521
00:20:15,110 --> 00:20:16,910
Please watch out when revers...

522
00:20:19,680 --> 00:20:20,790
Time to go!

523
00:20:21,620 --> 00:20:22,250
Bye-bye.

524
00:20:23,360 --> 00:20:24,880
Hold on tight! Hold on tight!

525
00:20:24,880 --> 00:20:26,070
Careful! Be safe!

526
00:20:26,070 --> 00:20:27,920
Careful! Be safe!

527
00:20:27,920 --> 00:20:28,880
Come back early!

528
00:20:30,000 --> 00:20:30,960
Careful!

529
00:20:35,120 --> 00:20:37,560
You two got a room before?

530
00:20:39,350 --> 00:20:39,750
Yeah.

531
00:20:40,720 --> 00:20:41,520
For business.

532
00:20:43,550 --> 00:20:44,480
Okay, it's fine.

533
00:20:44,830 --> 00:20:46,160
Take your time, no rush.

534
00:20:47,400 --> 00:20:48,480
You saw it too?

535
00:20:48,480 --> 00:20:48,960
Yes.

536
00:20:49,960 --> 00:20:51,420
They treated me like this.

537
00:20:52,240 --> 00:20:53,720
I don't plan to work with them anymore.

538
00:20:53,720 --> 00:20:55,270
I'll come to our village
to show my skills.

539
00:20:55,270 --> 00:20:56,750
Okay, it's settled.

540
00:20:58,070 --> 00:20:59,270
That's great, Chief.

541
00:20:59,590 --> 00:21:01,450
If you're so straightforward...

542
00:21:02,350 --> 00:21:03,550
-I…
-What did you say?

543
00:21:10,880 --> 00:21:11,640
Don't cry.

544
00:21:13,790 --> 00:21:14,790
Come, come, come.

545
00:21:14,960 --> 00:21:16,160
Don't cry, don't cry.

546
00:21:16,480 --> 00:21:17,810
Come, drink some water.

547
00:21:18,350 --> 00:21:18,950
Thank you.

548
00:21:25,200 --> 00:21:26,310
You saw it too.

549
00:21:27,440 --> 00:21:28,790
They treated me like this.

550
00:21:28,790 --> 00:21:30,350
I don't plan to work with them anymore.

551
00:21:30,350 --> 00:21:32,680
I'll come to our village
to show my skills.

552
00:21:33,880 --> 00:21:35,610
I just saw you show your skills.

553
00:21:37,750 --> 00:21:39,410
I offered my heart to the moon,

554
00:21:39,640 --> 00:21:41,440
but the moon shines on the ditch.

555
00:21:41,510 --> 00:21:43,710
Where mountains and rivers seem to end,

556
00:21:43,720 --> 00:21:45,070
a village appears among dark willows
and bright flowers.

557
00:21:45,070 --> 00:21:46,930
Get to the point. Get to the point.

558
00:21:47,160 --> 00:21:48,550
I've forsaken the darkness for the light.

559
00:21:48,550 --> 00:21:50,240
I won't stay in that village.
I'll go to another.

560
00:21:50,240 --> 00:21:51,590
I've come to our village.

561
00:21:51,590 --> 00:21:52,790
Please... please hire me.

562
00:21:52,790 --> 00:21:53,030
I...

563
00:21:53,030 --> 00:21:55,270
With me here,
our village will get better and better.

564
00:21:55,270 --> 00:21:56,400
Is that okay, Chief?

565
00:21:56,510 --> 00:21:57,000
Okay.

566
00:21:57,790 --> 00:22:00,110
Then tell me why we need you.

567
00:22:01,200 --> 00:22:03,260
I believe you must have heard my name.

568
00:22:04,030 --> 00:22:05,000
The cultural tourism of Shapu Village

569
00:22:05,000 --> 00:22:05,900
and the hometown of "King of Comedy"

570
00:22:05,900 --> 00:22:07,570
were organized by me alone.

571
00:22:08,110 --> 00:22:10,880
The Light of Shapu
is the title they gave me.

572
00:22:11,750 --> 00:22:13,920
Then how did I hear that Wudiren

573
00:22:14,200 --> 00:22:16,270
was invited by someone named Bingqiang?

574
00:22:16,270 --> 00:22:18,200
But I was the one who sent them away.

575
00:22:18,960 --> 00:22:20,440
Although I can't accomplish anything,

576
00:22:20,440 --> 00:22:22,190
I'm more than capable of ruining things.

577
00:22:22,190 --> 00:22:23,870
My ability to mess things up

578
00:22:23,890 --> 00:22:25,690
is far beyond your imagination.

579
00:22:26,000 --> 00:22:28,330
Of course, my strengths don't stop there.

580
00:22:28,350 --> 00:22:30,070
I still have a lot of talents.

581
00:22:30,310 --> 00:22:31,790
For example, as a planner,

582
00:22:32,110 --> 00:22:34,310
I can offer many, many strange ideas

583
00:22:34,310 --> 00:22:36,400
all to you.

584
00:22:36,400 --> 00:22:37,240
-For you...
-Alright.

585
00:22:37,240 --> 00:22:38,840
I believe you. It's settled.

586
00:22:39,790 --> 00:22:41,000
You are so straightforward.

587
00:22:41,000 --> 00:22:41,960
It has to be you.

588
00:22:42,030 --> 00:22:44,000
No wonder Chuanao Village
is developing so well.

589
00:22:44,000 --> 00:22:46,400
In the Period of Fire,
women should be in charge.

590
00:22:46,400 --> 00:22:48,110
From now on, I am
a Chuanao person with a Chuanao soul.

591
00:22:48,110 --> 00:22:51,160
I will go through fire and water
for whatever you ask me to do.

592
00:22:51,160 --> 00:22:53,830
I happen to have a task
I can assign to you.

593
00:22:54,110 --> 00:22:54,680
Tell me.

594
00:22:58,680 --> 00:23:00,480
Go undercover in Shapu Village.

595
00:23:13,480 --> 00:23:16,310
That's how it is.

596
00:23:16,750 --> 00:23:19,440
That's the situation.

597
00:23:22,000 --> 00:23:23,530
How did you get so beaten up?

598
00:23:23,920 --> 00:23:24,880
Look at this face.

599
00:23:24,880 --> 00:23:26,500
Who beat you up, Ke?

600
00:23:28,310 --> 00:23:29,240
What a pity.

601
00:23:30,260 --> 00:23:32,390
We had successfully gone undercover.

602
00:23:32,480 --> 00:23:34,720
How could he be sent back?

603
00:23:35,270 --> 00:23:36,800
Isn't he a double agent now?

604
00:23:42,750 --> 00:23:44,510
You are really stupid.

605
00:23:44,880 --> 00:23:47,180
It's obvious they saw through it.

606
00:23:48,090 --> 00:23:49,470
Did they see through it?

607
00:23:50,720 --> 00:23:52,000
Wait, which part went wrong?

608
00:23:52,000 --> 00:23:53,310
Your part went wrong.

609
00:23:53,330 --> 00:23:54,750
M-My hitting was too fake?

610
00:23:54,750 --> 00:23:57,350
If you had hit any harder,
I would have lost my life.

611
00:23:57,350 --> 00:23:58,350
Your acting was too fake.

612
00:23:58,350 --> 00:23:59,950
What kind of acting was that?

613
00:24:00,160 --> 00:24:02,180
Thief Zhou!

614
00:24:03,480 --> 00:24:05,590
Villain!

615
00:24:06,160 --> 00:24:09,640
Weren't we at Shapu Village
good enough to you?

616
00:24:09,750 --> 00:24:12,240
You actually defected to Chuanao Village!

617
00:24:12,240 --> 00:24:14,310
You traitor!

618
00:24:15,000 --> 00:24:16,000
Bro, don't get too worked up.

619
00:24:16,000 --> 00:24:17,200
Let's not be dramatic, okay?

620
00:24:17,200 --> 00:24:17,880
In

621
00:24:18,270 --> 00:24:18,960
your

622
00:24:19,400 --> 00:24:19,960
dreams!

623
00:24:22,310 --> 00:24:22,920
If you have the strength,

624
00:24:22,920 --> 00:24:24,850
you should use it to keep me, right?

625
00:24:25,310 --> 00:24:26,910
-I was so good to you!
-Right?

626
00:24:27,030 --> 00:24:29,030
The clothes you wear are all mine!

627
00:24:29,270 --> 00:24:30,600
I'll return them to you.

628
00:24:31,720 --> 00:24:33,400
And the pants!

629
00:24:35,960 --> 00:24:37,160
I'll return them too!

630
00:24:37,480 --> 00:24:37,920
Then I'll...

631
00:24:37,920 --> 00:24:39,680
I'll give them all to you. All to you.

632
00:24:39,680 --> 00:24:41,210
Don't ever harass me again!

633
00:24:44,000 --> 00:24:45,000
As soon as the female village chief
came out,

634
00:24:45,000 --> 00:24:45,830
there was no hitting part in the plan,

635
00:24:45,830 --> 00:24:47,110
but he really beat me up.

636
00:24:47,110 --> 00:24:47,790
Stop!

637
00:24:48,030 --> 00:24:48,890
Stop right now!

638
00:24:49,200 --> 00:24:50,680
You are an acting village chief after all.

639
00:24:50,680 --> 00:24:52,080
You can't hit the masses!

640
00:24:52,510 --> 00:24:53,170
He's crazy!

641
00:24:55,830 --> 00:24:56,480
Stop!

642
00:24:58,000 --> 00:24:58,480
I was just getting into character.

643
00:24:58,480 --> 00:24:59,240
What kind of acting was that?

644
00:24:59,240 --> 00:25:00,270
-This is nonsense.
-He was all wound up

645
00:25:00,270 --> 00:25:01,440
and took it out on me.

646
00:25:01,590 --> 00:25:02,610
Who took it out on you?

647
00:25:02,610 --> 00:25:04,590
Today's situation is also my fault.

648
00:25:04,590 --> 00:25:06,590
When we chose the undercover agent,

649
00:25:07,270 --> 00:25:08,670
I was too foolishly kind.

650
00:25:09,200 --> 00:25:11,030
I only considered Mr. Zhou's feelings

651
00:25:11,030 --> 00:25:12,830
and forgot about his abilities.

652
00:25:13,280 --> 00:25:13,790
You...

653
00:25:13,880 --> 00:25:14,680
It's my fault.

654
00:25:15,140 --> 00:25:16,750
If I had insisted back then...

655
00:25:16,750 --> 00:25:17,240
Right?

656
00:25:17,790 --> 00:25:19,200
I think Bingqiang is more suitable.

657
00:25:19,200 --> 00:25:21,030
Right. To be honest, Bingqiang and I...

658
00:25:21,030 --> 00:25:23,350
I don't think it would've ended up
like this if you had gone.

659
00:25:23,350 --> 00:25:25,070
I have to handle this.

660
00:25:25,090 --> 00:25:25,900
Bingqiang...

661
00:25:33,120 --> 00:25:34,520
Hello? Who is it?

662
00:25:34,550 --> 00:25:36,030
Came to join us.

663
00:25:40,920 --> 00:25:41,600
It's me.

664
00:25:48,720 --> 00:25:49,400
Who is it?

665
00:25:50,330 --> 00:25:51,310
Ma Feiyan.

666
00:26:04,070 --> 00:26:05,510
You're the undercover agent?

667
00:26:05,510 --> 00:26:06,310
That's right.

668
00:26:08,030 --> 00:26:09,630
Since you've figured it out,

669
00:26:09,860 --> 00:26:11,370
I am the undercover agent
sent by Chuanao Village

670
00:26:11,370 --> 00:26:12,540
to Shapu Village.

671
00:26:12,650 --> 00:26:14,240
You are the undercover agent
sent by Shapu.

672
00:26:14,240 --> 00:26:16,500
No, Chief Fang didn't want me to tell you.

673
00:26:16,920 --> 00:26:18,520
You are an undercover agent.

674
00:26:18,640 --> 00:26:19,310
No, I'm not.

675
00:26:19,310 --> 00:26:20,070
You are.

676
00:26:20,280 --> 00:26:21,280
No, he and I...

677
00:26:21,310 --> 00:26:22,160
-You are.
-No, he and I...

678
00:26:22,160 --> 00:26:23,400
-beat severely.
-You are.

679
00:26:23,400 --> 00:26:25,240
Wait, how did you figure it out?

680
00:26:26,000 --> 00:26:27,590
It's spread all over the village.

681
00:26:27,590 --> 00:26:28,240
Really?

682
00:26:28,240 --> 00:26:30,270
You and that guy at the village committee.

683
00:26:30,270 --> 00:26:32,400
Thief Zhou!

684
00:26:32,400 --> 00:26:34,300
Villian!

685
00:26:34,330 --> 00:26:36,250
Yes, what do you want from me?

686
00:26:37,200 --> 00:26:38,460
I want to work with you.

687
00:26:39,680 --> 00:26:41,540
What is there to work on together?

688
00:26:41,750 --> 00:26:44,610
I hope you continue
to investigate the sea monster.

689
00:26:46,070 --> 00:26:48,000
Didn't you create the sea monster?

690
00:26:48,870 --> 00:26:50,670
I didn't create the sea monster.

691
00:26:50,790 --> 00:26:51,890
I suspect

692
00:26:52,600 --> 00:26:54,260
my ex-brother-in-law did it.

693
00:26:54,440 --> 00:26:56,030
Who is your ex-brother-in-law?

694
00:26:56,030 --> 00:26:58,490
Mr. Huang,
who is messing with your village.

695
00:26:58,630 --> 00:27:00,160
There's such a connection?

696
00:27:00,270 --> 00:27:02,070
Aren't you guys in the same gang?

697
00:27:02,640 --> 00:27:04,550
Our family relationship
is a bit complicated.

698
00:27:04,550 --> 00:27:07,200
So, if the sea monster thing works out,

699
00:27:07,200 --> 00:27:10,330
he can replace me
and continue to mess with your village.

700
00:27:12,200 --> 00:27:14,310
Aren't you also messing with our village?
It's the same.

701
00:27:14,310 --> 00:27:14,960
It's not the same.

702
00:27:14,960 --> 00:27:16,000
There's a big difference.

703
00:27:16,000 --> 00:27:18,310
I'm messing with Shapu
because I want to mess with him.

704
00:27:18,310 --> 00:27:20,590
If we join forces to bring him down,

705
00:27:21,600 --> 00:27:22,670
then I promise you,

706
00:27:22,750 --> 00:27:24,880
no one
will continue to mess with your village.

707
00:27:24,880 --> 00:27:26,210
Is that sincere enough?

708
00:27:28,550 --> 00:27:29,550
Let me summarize.

709
00:27:29,680 --> 00:27:30,590
Thieves robbing thieves.

710
00:27:30,590 --> 00:27:31,400
Who are the thieves?

711
00:27:31,400 --> 00:27:32,000
I'm sorry.

712
00:27:32,200 --> 00:27:33,530
W-Why did you choose me?

713
00:27:34,440 --> 00:27:35,300
Good question.

714
00:27:35,310 --> 00:27:36,110
Let's put it this way.

715
00:27:36,110 --> 00:27:37,480
Right now, Fang Hua

716
00:27:37,480 --> 00:27:39,700
and Mr. Huang are watching me too closely.

717
00:27:39,700 --> 00:27:42,160
If I make a move,
I'll definitely alert them.

718
00:27:42,270 --> 00:27:44,510
But no one would expect us
to work together.

719
00:27:44,510 --> 00:27:46,110
So you are my best candidate.

720
00:27:46,350 --> 00:27:47,680
No other reasons?

721
00:27:48,270 --> 00:27:48,870
Like what?

722
00:27:49,200 --> 00:27:49,790
Ability.

723
00:27:50,960 --> 00:27:51,790
Of course, there are.

724
00:27:51,790 --> 00:27:53,110
You, Zhou Ke,

725
00:27:53,480 --> 00:27:55,180
are ordinary-looking and short.

726
00:27:55,180 --> 00:27:56,110
If you were thrown into a crowd...

727
00:27:56,110 --> 00:27:57,350
Alright, I get it.

728
00:27:58,480 --> 00:28:01,080
Is this what they mean
by hiding in plain sight?

729
00:28:02,000 --> 00:28:02,720
Spot on.

730
00:28:03,590 --> 00:28:05,320
Then why should I work with you?

731
00:28:05,440 --> 00:28:06,170
I have money.

732
00:28:06,350 --> 00:28:08,030
I can cover all the expenses

733
00:28:08,030 --> 00:28:09,160
for your operation.

734
00:28:11,510 --> 00:28:12,570
Where am I staying?

735
00:28:14,720 --> 00:28:15,250
How is it?

736
00:28:16,510 --> 00:28:16,960
Bro.

737
00:28:17,960 --> 00:28:18,720
This room

738
00:28:19,200 --> 00:28:19,880
cost 380?

739
00:28:20,640 --> 00:28:22,640
Well, there are a lot of tourists lately.

740
00:28:22,640 --> 00:28:24,300
I even had to pull some strings

741
00:28:24,880 --> 00:28:26,210
to get this room for you.

742
00:28:26,680 --> 00:28:28,510
Do you know who I had to ask

743
00:28:28,510 --> 00:28:29,640
and where I had to go?

744
00:28:29,640 --> 00:28:31,300
Where did you find this place?

745
00:28:32,590 --> 00:28:34,350
Don't ask so many questions.
Just stay here.

746
00:28:34,350 --> 00:28:35,200
-Okay?
-Okay.

747
00:28:36,350 --> 00:28:38,920
This isn't really a hotel, is it?

748
00:28:40,310 --> 00:28:41,440
It's a themed hotel.

749
00:28:41,510 --> 00:28:42,550
What's the theme?

750
00:28:44,680 --> 00:28:47,000
Recalling past bitterness
and savoring the sweetness.

751
00:28:47,000 --> 00:28:47,640
Yeah.

752
00:28:49,190 --> 00:28:50,250
It's quite bitter.

753
00:28:51,480 --> 00:28:52,750
If I'm not mistaken,

754
00:28:53,030 --> 00:28:54,110
this must be the toilet.

755
00:28:54,110 --> 00:28:55,170
You guessed wrong.

756
00:28:55,830 --> 00:28:57,640
That's next door's. That room costs 580.

757
00:28:57,640 --> 00:29:00,040
For the toilet,
just follow this sign down.

758
00:29:01,030 --> 00:29:02,690
Right, the blue one with a lid.

759
00:29:03,120 --> 00:29:03,780
The toilet.

760
00:29:06,000 --> 00:29:07,400
The 180 one is a squat toilet.

761
00:29:07,400 --> 00:29:08,530
That's pretty good.

762
00:29:09,440 --> 00:29:12,200
Then bro, what are these red ones?

763
00:29:12,350 --> 00:29:14,270
There's just no room left for these.

764
00:29:14,270 --> 00:29:15,880
I'll just leave them here for a while.

765
00:29:15,880 --> 00:29:17,030
Alright, scan the code.

766
00:29:17,030 --> 00:29:17,750
Scan that?

767
00:29:18,830 --> 00:29:19,960
That's a floor lamp.

768
00:29:20,110 --> 00:29:21,160
What's the use of scanning it?

769
00:29:21,160 --> 00:29:22,220
Scan this one here.

770
00:29:27,070 --> 00:29:28,310
I came to join Ms. Ma.

771
00:29:28,510 --> 00:29:31,370
Didn't Ms. Ma say she'd arrange
the accommodation?

772
00:29:31,880 --> 00:29:33,210
Let me tell you a secret.

773
00:29:34,000 --> 00:29:34,750
Ms. Ma

774
00:29:35,640 --> 00:29:36,640
wants to test you.

775
00:29:40,450 --> 00:29:41,300
Zhen,

776
00:29:42,240 --> 00:29:43,550
I found a treasure.

777
00:29:44,480 --> 00:29:46,000
It's our dad's work diary.

778
00:29:47,240 --> 00:29:50,400
I'm reading the chapter
on the defense of the turtle pond.

779
00:29:50,400 --> 00:29:52,680
It's exactly the same
as our current situation.

780
00:29:52,680 --> 00:29:54,400
Both involve sending an undercover agent.

781
00:29:54,400 --> 00:29:55,110
Brother.

782
00:29:55,820 --> 00:29:57,270
With him all by himself over there,

783
00:29:57,270 --> 00:29:58,730
do you think he'll be okay?

784
00:29:59,270 --> 00:30:01,590
I just feel a bit uneasy.

785
00:30:02,160 --> 00:30:03,160
You mean Mr. Zhou?

786
00:30:05,350 --> 00:30:07,070
If you doubt someone, don't use them.

787
00:30:07,070 --> 00:30:08,680
If you use them, don't doubt them.

788
00:30:08,680 --> 00:30:10,810
I believe that with Mr. Zhou's talent,

789
00:30:11,200 --> 00:30:13,550
he will definitely thrive
in Chuanao Village,

790
00:30:13,550 --> 00:30:15,240
make a great success of it,

791
00:30:15,510 --> 00:30:16,710
and be in his element.

792
00:30:17,640 --> 00:30:19,170
Your idioms have improved.

793
00:30:20,720 --> 00:30:23,520
These two phrases
just happened to be in his diary.

794
00:30:29,750 --> 00:30:30,880
Tell me,

795
00:30:31,240 --> 00:30:33,950
letting these villagers stay

796
00:30:34,350 --> 00:30:35,950
to do what they are doing now—

797
00:30:37,240 --> 00:30:38,770
was it the right thing to do?

798
00:30:52,160 --> 00:30:53,000
Sister.

799
00:30:54,440 --> 00:30:55,200
Everyone

800
00:30:55,680 --> 00:30:57,160
has moments of confusion.

801
00:30:58,510 --> 00:31:01,110
Whenever we encounter
this kind of situation,

802
00:31:01,160 --> 00:31:03,160
you need to find someone around you,

803
00:31:03,270 --> 00:31:04,510
who is the closest,

804
00:31:05,440 --> 00:31:06,440
most trusted,

805
00:31:07,240 --> 00:31:09,400
and capable of helping you
solve the problem

806
00:31:09,400 --> 00:31:11,000
to have a conversation with.

807
00:31:12,550 --> 00:31:13,480
Luckily,

808
00:31:14,160 --> 00:31:15,690
you have me as your brother.

809
00:31:16,960 --> 00:31:18,410
And I happen to have time.

810
00:31:21,310 --> 00:31:22,000
Ask away.

811
00:31:24,440 --> 00:31:26,350
Brother, go to sleep.

812
00:31:28,110 --> 00:31:28,830
Me?

813
00:31:54,920 --> 00:31:57,580
How are things on your end?
Is it going smoothly?

814
00:31:59,440 --> 00:32:01,640
I've successfully infiltrated the enemy.

815
00:32:01,640 --> 00:32:03,240
Don't worry. I'm doing fine.

816
00:32:17,270 --> 00:32:18,870
I have something to tell you.

817
00:32:21,310 --> 00:32:23,270
Go ahead. I'm all ears.

818
00:32:30,440 --> 00:32:31,400
Zhou Ke.

819
00:32:32,070 --> 00:32:32,960
Well,

820
00:32:33,160 --> 00:32:33,820
you know...

821
00:32:43,550 --> 00:32:45,410
Never mind. Let's talk tomorrow.

822
00:32:51,620 --> 00:32:53,820
[Zhen recalled a message.]

823
00:33:00,550 --> 00:33:00,960
I...

824
00:33:21,920 --> 00:33:23,380
Back up! Back up some more!

825
00:33:23,920 --> 00:33:24,380
Back up!

826
00:33:27,680 --> 00:33:28,310
Back up!

827
00:33:29,550 --> 00:33:30,070
Back up!

828
00:33:31,720 --> 00:33:33,510
Back up! Back up some more!

829
00:33:33,960 --> 00:33:35,750
Jiaoqi, stop directing traffic over there.

830
00:33:35,750 --> 00:33:37,280
Hurry up and pull together!

831
00:33:37,790 --> 00:33:38,920
This useless thing.

832
00:33:42,110 --> 00:33:42,570
Come on!

833
00:33:43,900 --> 00:33:44,420
Come on!

834
00:33:44,450 --> 00:33:44,970
Done.

835
00:33:46,880 --> 00:33:47,740
Good position.

836
00:33:48,030 --> 00:33:48,590
Jiaoqi,

837
00:33:48,830 --> 00:33:50,160
what is this thing?

838
00:33:50,590 --> 00:33:52,400
It broke so fast.
The remote doesn't even work.

839
00:33:52,400 --> 00:33:53,030
Look at you,

840
00:33:53,030 --> 00:33:55,560
how did you manage
to break it while steering?

841
00:33:55,750 --> 00:33:57,070
Jiaoqi, you don't understand.

842
00:33:57,070 --> 00:33:58,200
This thing was in the sea.

843
00:33:58,200 --> 00:33:59,250
It's different from driving.

844
00:33:59,250 --> 00:34:00,380
I'm good at driving.

845
00:34:00,440 --> 00:34:01,510
Driving is all about...

846
00:34:01,510 --> 00:34:02,040
Alright.

847
00:34:03,160 --> 00:34:04,030
At least, they believed it.

848
00:34:04,030 --> 00:34:05,430
That's all that matters.

849
00:34:06,440 --> 00:34:07,030
Tell me, Jiaoqi,

850
00:34:07,030 --> 00:34:08,710
how can the people in Chuanao

851
00:34:08,710 --> 00:34:10,800
believe there's a sea monster?

852
00:34:11,630 --> 00:34:13,489
Just look at the Loch Ness Monster

853
00:34:14,070 --> 00:34:15,070
and the Lake Tianchi Monster.

854
00:34:15,070 --> 00:34:16,360
Don't people still believe in them?

855
00:34:16,360 --> 00:34:17,360
Aren't they real?

856
00:34:18,840 --> 00:34:20,500
Do you believe in Santa Claus?

857
00:34:21,110 --> 00:34:22,040
You got me there.

858
00:34:24,480 --> 00:34:26,230
You really live up to your education.

859
00:34:26,230 --> 00:34:26,960
I...

860
00:34:28,260 --> 00:34:30,860
People only believe
what they want to believe.

861
00:34:31,280 --> 00:34:33,100
Does it matter if the sea monster
is real or fake?

862
00:34:33,100 --> 00:34:34,850
The masses are blind followers,

863
00:34:34,850 --> 00:34:36,250
just going with the flow.

864
00:34:36,440 --> 00:34:37,900
You'll understand later.

865
00:34:38,190 --> 00:34:40,790
Jiaoqi, since when did you
become so profound?

866
00:34:41,630 --> 00:34:42,880
When Mr. Huang
was taking a successology class,

867
00:34:42,880 --> 00:34:44,679
I was standing by, listening in.

868
00:34:45,510 --> 00:34:47,150
Take me with you next time.
I want to listen too.

869
00:34:47,150 --> 00:34:48,679
I want to be successful too.

870
00:34:48,920 --> 00:34:49,980
Hurry up. Hurry up.

871
00:34:55,400 --> 00:34:56,480
Today on our show,

872
00:34:55,429 --> 00:35:01,520
[Shock! Sea Monster Found
in Coastal Tourist Village]

873
00:34:56,480 --> 00:34:59,230
we are honored to invite Director Xu
from the aquarium

874
00:34:59,230 --> 00:35:01,280
to give us a brief popular science talk.

875
00:35:01,280 --> 00:35:02,510
This sea monster in Chuanao Village.

876
00:35:02,510 --> 00:35:03,550
It's a sea monster,

877
00:35:03,550 --> 00:35:04,440
in the sea.

878
00:35:04,840 --> 00:35:06,150
We need this...

879
00:35:06,150 --> 00:35:08,230
It looks very strange, you know?

880
00:35:12,800 --> 00:35:13,800
We saw on the internet

881
00:35:13,800 --> 00:35:14,920
that you have sea excursion projects here.

882
00:35:14,920 --> 00:35:15,510
That's why we came over.

883
00:35:15,510 --> 00:35:16,880
No. The sea is not safe right now.

884
00:35:16,880 --> 00:35:18,590
That's not what your promotion said.

885
00:35:18,590 --> 00:35:20,280
That was the old promotion.

886
00:35:20,400 --> 00:35:21,710
There's a sea monster out there now.

887
00:35:21,710 --> 00:35:23,960
Even if there is,
we want to go out and see it!

888
00:35:23,960 --> 00:35:25,690
You want to see the sea monster?

889
00:35:25,800 --> 00:35:26,400
Go to Chuanao Village.

890
00:35:26,400 --> 00:35:27,740
What kind of attitude is this?

891
00:35:27,740 --> 00:35:29,460
We came all the way here!

892
00:35:29,730 --> 00:35:30,660
What's going on?

893
00:35:31,190 --> 00:35:32,340
What are you talking about?

894
00:35:32,340 --> 00:35:32,840
Stop arguing!

895
00:35:32,840 --> 00:35:34,640
You must give us an explanation!

896
00:35:35,360 --> 00:35:36,280
Mr. Shark!

897
00:35:36,480 --> 00:35:37,410
What's going on?

898
00:35:38,030 --> 00:35:39,630
-They insisted on going out to sea.
-Yeah.

899
00:35:39,630 --> 00:35:41,630
We can't go out to sea. It's not safe.

900
00:35:42,590 --> 00:35:44,360
Hello, tourists.

901
00:35:44,760 --> 00:35:45,960
Let me introduce you.

902
00:35:46,070 --> 00:35:47,710
This is the president
of our Shafa Committee,

903
00:35:47,710 --> 00:35:48,710
Ms. Chen Jiazhen.

904
00:35:48,840 --> 00:35:51,300
And the vice president,
Mr. Chen Bingqiang.

905
00:35:51,550 --> 00:35:54,150
I am a native of Shapu Village,

906
00:35:54,590 --> 00:35:56,840
the eldest son
of the former village chief,

907
00:35:56,840 --> 00:35:59,900
and the current acting village chief,
Mr. Chen Jiahao.

908
00:36:00,110 --> 00:36:01,000
If you have any problems,

909
00:36:01,000 --> 00:36:02,590
you can talk to me calmly.

910
00:36:03,000 --> 00:36:04,510
We saw on the internet

911
00:36:04,510 --> 00:36:05,800
that you have sea excursions here.

912
00:36:05,800 --> 00:36:07,400
We came all the way here,

913
00:36:07,400 --> 00:36:08,710
and today you tell us
we can't go out to sea!

914
00:36:08,710 --> 00:36:09,250
Why?

915
00:36:09,280 --> 00:36:11,080
You must give us an explanation!

916
00:36:11,630 --> 00:36:13,320
There's a sea monster out there now.

917
00:36:13,320 --> 00:36:15,480
It's not safe for them to go out to sea.

918
00:36:15,480 --> 00:36:16,710
Wait, Mr. Shark.

919
00:36:17,000 --> 00:36:17,760
In that video,

920
00:36:17,760 --> 00:36:18,920
didn't you see Gao Jiaoqi

921
00:36:18,920 --> 00:36:19,840
and Fei?

922
00:36:19,880 --> 00:36:21,280
They are in the same gang as Ma Feiyan.

923
00:36:21,280 --> 00:36:22,540
Maybe they set this up.

924
00:36:22,630 --> 00:36:24,510
A video is just a video.

925
00:36:24,630 --> 00:36:26,150
What if there really is a sea monster?

926
00:36:26,150 --> 00:36:26,960
Mr. Shark,

927
00:36:27,190 --> 00:36:29,510
there's definitely something wrong
with this sea monster thing.

928
00:36:29,510 --> 00:36:31,150
None of us have ever seen a sea monster.

929
00:36:31,150 --> 00:36:32,190
Just based on that video,

930
00:36:32,190 --> 00:36:33,630
if we don't take tourists out to sea,

931
00:36:33,630 --> 00:36:35,360
they will give us bad reviews,

932
00:36:35,480 --> 00:36:36,550
and our reputation will be ruined.

933
00:36:36,550 --> 00:36:37,800
Wouldn't we be falling into their trap?

934
00:36:37,800 --> 00:36:40,030
Chuanao Village has already
stopped going out to sea.

935
00:36:40,030 --> 00:36:41,550
There must be something wrong.

936
00:36:41,550 --> 00:36:43,360
It's better to be safe than sorry.

937
00:36:43,360 --> 00:36:44,760
-Zhen, we'd better be careful.
-Yeah.

938
00:36:44,760 --> 00:36:46,360
Auntie Chaoyue, that's not right.

939
00:36:46,360 --> 00:36:47,160
Zhen is right.

940
00:36:47,230 --> 00:36:48,090
I support Zhen.

941
00:36:48,440 --> 00:36:49,280
We should be able to go out to sea.

942
00:36:49,280 --> 00:36:50,610
You don't have a boat!

943
00:36:50,640 --> 00:36:51,760
Why are you getting involved?

944
00:36:51,760 --> 00:36:52,880
-It's none of your business!
-Mr. Shark.

945
00:36:52,880 --> 00:36:53,740
How about this?

946
00:36:53,920 --> 00:36:55,000
If you are afraid,

947
00:36:55,230 --> 00:36:57,070
give me the keys. I can drive the boat.

948
00:36:57,070 --> 00:36:58,630
I'll take the tourists out to sea, okay?

949
00:36:58,630 --> 00:36:59,280
No, no.

950
00:36:59,360 --> 00:37:00,670
-No one can go to sea.
-It's too dangerous.

951
00:37:00,670 --> 00:37:02,760
Your father didn't come back
from the sea back then.

952
00:37:02,760 --> 00:37:04,360
Maybe he encountered a sea monster.

953
00:37:04,360 --> 00:37:04,760
Right.

954
00:37:04,960 --> 00:37:06,360
What did you work out?

955
00:37:06,360 --> 00:37:07,670
Can we go out to sea today or not?

956
00:37:07,670 --> 00:37:09,870
We will definitely solve this problem!

957
00:37:10,480 --> 00:37:12,190
You must give us an explanation today!

958
00:37:12,190 --> 00:37:13,550
We need an explanation!

959
00:37:13,570 --> 00:37:15,380
All this talk and no solution!

960
00:37:19,030 --> 00:37:19,680
Haidan.

961
00:37:19,700 --> 00:37:21,150
I'll go out to sea!

962
00:37:21,550 --> 00:37:23,630
I believe Zhen!

963
00:37:24,110 --> 00:37:25,840
Chen Haidan, come back here!

964
00:37:25,840 --> 00:37:26,570
Chen Haidan!

965
00:37:26,810 --> 00:37:28,230
Chen Haidan, come back here!

966
00:37:28,230 --> 00:37:29,020
Do you hear me?

967
00:37:29,020 --> 00:37:30,760
I want to prove to everyone

968
00:37:31,320 --> 00:37:33,360
that there is no sea monster in the sea!

969
00:37:33,360 --> 00:37:34,360
Mr. Haidan!

970
00:37:34,360 --> 00:37:35,620
You can't go out to sea!

971
00:37:35,960 --> 00:37:36,960
Be careful!

972
00:37:36,960 --> 00:37:38,880
-Be careful!
-Be careful!

973
00:37:39,320 --> 00:37:41,630
-Be careful!
-Be careful!

974
00:37:46,960 --> 00:37:48,290
Bingqiang, Bingqiang.

975
00:37:48,550 --> 00:37:49,230
Bingqiang, Bingqiang.

976
00:37:49,230 --> 00:37:50,280
Dear tourists,

977
00:37:50,630 --> 00:37:51,320
you all came here

978
00:37:51,320 --> 00:37:52,630
for our water activities, right?

979
00:37:52,630 --> 00:37:53,690
Yes, that's right.

980
00:37:53,710 --> 00:37:55,880
But everyone can see the situation now.

981
00:37:55,880 --> 00:37:57,280
What you don't know

982
00:37:57,280 --> 00:37:58,550
is that our village has even more

983
00:37:58,550 --> 00:38:00,550
colorful folk activities.

984
00:38:00,630 --> 00:38:01,360
Since you're here,

985
00:38:01,360 --> 00:38:03,030
you haven't tried
our special fish balls yet, have you?

986
00:38:03,030 --> 00:38:04,320
-Not yet.
-Not yet.

987
00:38:04,360 --> 00:38:05,480
My treat,

988
00:38:05,670 --> 00:38:06,070
okay?

989
00:38:06,360 --> 00:38:07,360
And our village

990
00:38:07,360 --> 00:38:10,190
has a very, very effective love tree.

991
00:38:10,360 --> 00:38:11,630
Are you two a couple?

992
00:38:11,830 --> 00:38:12,920
-I'm her brother.
-He is my brother.

993
00:38:12,920 --> 00:38:14,000
That's right.

994
00:38:14,320 --> 00:38:15,800
I hope everyone can experience

995
00:38:15,800 --> 00:38:17,960
the beauty and sweetness of love, okay?

996
00:38:17,960 --> 00:38:18,960
This way, please.

997
00:38:19,110 --> 00:38:20,360
Look at what you guys said,

998
00:38:20,360 --> 00:38:22,420
and look at how he talks. So handsome.

999
00:38:22,510 --> 00:38:23,550
Let's go.

1000
00:38:23,550 --> 00:38:25,230
Come, this way, please.

1001
00:38:25,820 --> 00:38:27,280
Be careful, mind the step.

1002
00:38:28,550 --> 00:38:30,320
Tell me, where are you taking me today?

1003
00:38:30,320 --> 00:38:31,050
Look at this.

1004
00:38:32,800 --> 00:38:34,230
Room 208.

1005
00:38:34,370 --> 00:38:35,820
Room... 20...

1006
00:38:36,510 --> 00:38:39,190
What are you doing?

1007
00:38:39,550 --> 00:38:40,840
What are you doing?

1008
00:38:42,550 --> 00:38:43,880
What are you thinking?

1009
00:38:44,280 --> 00:38:45,000
I found out.

1010
00:38:45,190 --> 00:38:46,150
Found out what?

1011
00:38:46,670 --> 00:38:47,960
Gao Jiaoqi's address.

1012
00:38:49,590 --> 00:38:50,720
Give this to Zhou Ke.

1013
00:38:51,710 --> 00:38:53,280
Why don't you just send him a message?

1014
00:38:53,280 --> 00:38:54,680
Why did you write a note?

1015
00:38:54,710 --> 00:38:58,030
Are you stupid?
Sending a message leaves evidence.

1016
00:38:58,550 --> 00:38:59,480
I wrote this note

1017
00:38:59,920 --> 00:39:01,030
with my left hand.

1018
00:39:01,480 --> 00:39:03,630
No one can tell it's my handwriting.

1019
00:39:04,000 --> 00:39:05,880
This isn't even human handwriting.

1020
00:39:05,880 --> 00:39:07,400
I can only read 208.

1021
00:39:08,150 --> 00:39:08,920
And room.

1022
00:39:09,800 --> 00:39:10,760
Is it too messy?

1023
00:39:11,580 --> 00:39:13,180
Then I'll rewrite it.

1024
00:39:17,240 --> 00:39:18,470
Do you have a pen?

1025
00:39:34,070 --> 00:39:34,800
Hello, Sir.

1026
00:39:35,760 --> 00:39:37,490
Are you a resident or a visitor?

1027
00:39:38,590 --> 00:39:39,250
A resident.

1028
00:39:39,710 --> 00:39:40,910
Which room are you in?

1029
00:39:41,800 --> 00:39:42,360
208.

1030
00:39:42,630 --> 00:39:43,320
208?

1031
00:39:43,800 --> 00:39:46,130
I remember 208's residents are like this.

1032
00:39:51,110 --> 00:39:51,710
Gao.

1033
00:39:52,190 --> 00:39:53,630
The three of us are together, you know?

1034
00:39:53,630 --> 00:39:54,560
I'll go up first.

1035
00:39:54,600 --> 00:39:56,670
Wait a moment. I'll notify them for you.

1036
00:39:56,670 --> 00:39:58,480
No need. I'll do it myself.

1037
00:39:58,480 --> 00:39:58,960
It's fine.

1038
00:39:58,960 --> 00:40:00,280
-He'll open the door for me.
-Juan. Juan.

1039
00:40:00,280 --> 00:40:01,070
Alright.

1040
00:40:02,670 --> 00:40:03,600
This is too much.

1041
00:40:04,400 --> 00:40:05,280
This Gao.

1042
00:40:05,630 --> 00:40:07,760
He didn't tell you I was coming, did he?

1043
00:40:08,480 --> 00:40:09,610
This is outrageous.

1044
00:40:09,760 --> 00:40:10,800
I'll call and scold him.

1045
00:40:10,800 --> 00:40:11,760
I'll ask him to come down
and pick me up, okay?

1046
00:40:11,760 --> 00:40:12,760
Don't worry, okay?

1047
00:40:12,760 --> 00:40:13,760
I'll call him.

1048
00:40:14,450 --> 00:40:15,250
I'll call him.

1049
00:40:20,480 --> 00:40:21,410
What's going on?

1050
00:40:23,070 --> 00:40:24,930
I'm here, and they won't let me in.

1051
00:40:27,240 --> 00:40:27,920
Come down.

1052
00:40:30,280 --> 00:40:30,710
You...

1053
00:40:53,800 --> 00:40:56,000
You don't think anyone
knows we live here, do you?

1054
00:40:56,000 --> 00:40:57,260
Probably no one knows.

1055
00:41:00,030 --> 00:41:02,190
Jiaoqi, do you think
this guesthouse is clean?

1056
00:41:02,190 --> 00:41:02,510
What's wrong?

1057
00:41:02,510 --> 00:41:05,230
Why is he wiping the handle with a mop?

1058
00:41:05,920 --> 00:41:06,850
I didn't notice.

1059
00:41:10,000 --> 00:41:11,360
Are you...

1060
00:41:11,960 --> 00:41:12,550
New here.

1061
00:41:15,590 --> 00:41:17,120
Your name is Zhang Xiujuan?

1062
00:41:20,880 --> 00:41:22,080
We have the same name?

1063
00:41:25,590 --> 00:41:26,720
What a coincidence.

1064
00:41:27,000 --> 00:41:27,930
Nice to meet you.

1065
00:41:31,070 --> 00:41:32,530
Eating seafood every day.

1066
00:41:33,280 --> 00:41:34,760
-Nothing else.
-Yeah.

1067
00:41:35,670 --> 00:41:37,530
Eating these scallops every day.

1068
00:41:50,030 --> 00:41:50,630
Hello.

1069
00:41:54,640 --> 00:41:55,410
Wind chimes.

1070
00:41:55,670 --> 00:41:56,880
Do you want a lollipop?

1071
00:41:56,880 --> 00:41:57,630
Sure.

1072
00:41:58,840 --> 00:41:59,670
I want that one. That one.

1073
00:41:59,670 --> 00:42:00,880
It's too hard not to see him.

1074
00:42:00,880 --> 00:42:02,280
Just standing there.

1075
00:42:04,150 --> 00:42:04,680
Let's go.

1076
00:42:07,510 --> 00:42:08,440
Your super boba.

1077
00:42:12,400 --> 00:42:12,860
Did I...

1078
00:42:13,150 --> 00:42:13,800
order this?

1079
00:42:13,800 --> 00:42:14,280
Yes, you did.

1080
00:42:14,280 --> 00:42:14,840
Order...

1081
00:42:16,400 --> 00:42:17,200
How much is it?

1082
00:42:17,230 --> 00:42:17,890
Sixty yuan.

1083
00:42:21,230 --> 00:42:22,190
What the heck?

1084
00:42:23,920 --> 00:42:24,870
Jiaoqi, try this.

1085
00:42:24,870 --> 00:42:25,700
You eat yours.

1086
00:42:26,070 --> 00:42:27,400
There are new ones here.

1087
00:42:32,550 --> 00:42:33,590
I'm stuffed.

1088
00:42:37,710 --> 00:42:39,120
Jiaoqi, when do you think
the sea monster in this village

1089
00:42:39,120 --> 00:42:40,480
will appear again?

1090
00:42:40,510 --> 00:42:42,110
You... keep your voice down.

1091
00:42:42,230 --> 00:42:43,440
Lower your voice.

1092
00:42:43,790 --> 00:42:45,660
Isn't it too obvious for him to sit there?
